<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ report_title }}</title>
<style>
  :root{
   --bg:#0c111d; --panel:#141b2c; --panel2:#1a2338; --line:#2a3450; --line-soft:#212a41;
   --text:#eef1f7; --muted:#8a93ad; --muted2:#c3c9db;
   --accent:#d98a4f; --accent-soft:#a8683a; --accent2:#5fb8ab;
   --mono:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,"SF Mono","Cascadia Code",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
   --serif:ui-serif,Georgia,"Iowan Old Style","Palatino Linotype",serif;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: light){
   :root{
    --bg:#f5f7fb; --panel:#ffffff; --panel2:#eef1f8; --line:#d7deec; --line-soft:#e3e8f3;
    --text:#131a2c; --muted:#5b6478; --muted2:#333d54;
    --accent:#b8672f; --accent-soft:#8f4f24; --accent2:#2f8a7d;
   }
  }
  body { font-family: -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",system-ui,sans-serif; color: var(--text); margin: 0; padding: 0 32px 48px; background: var(--bg); }
  header { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 28px 0 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  header h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.01em; font-size: 26px; color: var(--text); }
  header .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
  header .meta a { color: var(--accent2); }
  h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.01em; font-size: 17px; color: var(--text); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 32px; }
  .highlights { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin: 16px 0; }
  .card { flex: 1 1 150px; background: var(--panel2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 14px; }
  .card .label { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.03em; }
  .card .value { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); margin-top: 2px; }
  .card .date { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }
  .narrative { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; background: var(--panel2); border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); padding: 12px 16px; margin: 16px 0; color: var(--text); }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 12px 0 24px; font-size: 13px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 6px 10px; text-align: right; color: var(--text); }
  th { background: var(--panel2); color: var(--text); font-family: var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.03em; font-size: 11px; text-align: right; }
  td:first-child, th:first-child { text-align: left; }
  .chart { margin: 16px 0; text-align: center; }
  .chart img { max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; }
  footer.report-footer { margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
  code { font-family: var(--mono); background: var(--panel2); color: var(--muted2); padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px; }

  .section.support { margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .section.support p { color: var(--text); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  .section.support p.demo-context { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .section.support .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 14px; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; background: var(--accent); color: #20130a; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px; }
  .btn.secondary { background: transparent; color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--line); }

  footer.site-footer { margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
  footer.site-footer .footer-inner { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  footer.site-footer .legal-links a { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted2); text-decoration: none; margin-right: 16px; }
  footer.site-footer .legal-links a:last-child { margin-right: 0; }
  footer.site-footer .copyright { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <h1>{{ report_title }}</h1>
  <div class="meta">{{ facts.location }} &middot; generated {{ facts.generated_at }} &middot; source: <a href="{{ facts.source_url }}">Open-Meteo API</a></div>
</header>

<h2>This Week at a Glance</h2>
<div class="highlights">
  {% for h in selected_highlights %}
  <div class="card">
    <div class="label">{{ h.label }}</div>
    <div class="value">{{ h.value }}{{ h.unit }}</div>
    {% if h.date %}<div class="date">{{ h.date }}</div>{% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<h2>Briefing</h2>
<div class="narrative">{{ narrative }}</div>

<h2>Temperature</h2>
<div class="chart"><img src="{{ chart_temperature_path }}" alt="Temperature chart"></div>

<h2>Precipitation</h2>
<div class="chart"><img src="{{ chart_precipitation_path }}" alt="Precipitation chart"></div>

<h2>Daily Data</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Date</th><th>High (°C)</th><th>Low (°C)</th><th>Precip (mm)</th><th>Wind max (km/h)</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for d in facts.days %}
    <tr><td>{{ d.date }}</td><td>{{ d.tmax }}</td><td>{{ d.tmin }}</td><td>{{ d.precip_mm }}</td><td>{{ d.wind_max_kmh }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<footer class="report-footer">
  Generated by CADS-DEMO-newsletter. Every figure above comes directly from the Open-Meteo forecast API
  response (<code>{{ facts.source_url }}</code>); the narrative text above was written by
  <code>{{ model_name }}</code> selecting and phrasing these figures under an enforced facts-only guard
  {% if llm_fallback_used %}&mdash; note: the LLM output failed the guard on this run, so the narrative
  above is the deterministic fallback sentence, not model-written prose{% endif %}.
  This is a demo artifact; forecast data is not archived and will differ on each regeneration.
</footer>

<div class="section support">
 <p class="demo-context">This weekly briefing is one demo in the bunsenbrenner.org portfolio.</p>
 <p><strong>Keep the lab running.</strong> Bunsenbrenner is free to use and runs on donated time and
 server costs. If it helped you get something live, a small contribution keeps it going.</p>
 <div class="actions">
  <a class="btn" href="https://steady.page/plans/77a32d9c-c399-4ca1-9515-7a628c7a9413" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Support as a member &rarr;</a>
  <a class="btn secondary" href="https://buymeacoffee.com/bunsenbrenner" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy me a coffee &rarr;</a>
  <a class="btn secondary" href="https://github.com/scimbe/CADS-Tunnel" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub &mdash; feature requests, code review, issues &rarr;</a>
 </div>
</div>

<footer class="site-footer">
 <div class="footer-inner">
  <div class="legal-links"><a href="https://bunsenbrenner.org/legal-notice">Legal Notice</a><a href="https://bunsenbrenner.org/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a><a href="https://bunsenbrenner.org/terms-of-use">Terms of Use</a></div>
  <div class="copyright">&copy; Bunsenbrenner.org &mdash; Martin Becke</div>
 </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
